  "referenceNumber": "RUS3532",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers there are reasonable grounds to suspect Gulnara Vilsurovna ANDROSOVA (hereafter ANDROSOVA) is an “involved person” under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the basis of the following ground: ANDROSOVA is and has been involved in destabilising Ukraine by engaging in and providing support for action which undermines or threatens the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine by working as a writer in the Social Design Agency (SDA). \n",
